      "name": "Submit",
      "qualifiedName": "arda::FArdaDependencyGraph::Submit",
      "kind": "method",
      "component": "core",
      "page": "api-reference.html",
      "signature": "[[nodiscard]] TArdaRHIResult<FArdaDependencyFrameTicket> Submit(const FArdaGraphExecuteOptions& Options = {})",
      "summary": "Record and submit one frame on the calling thread, returning its GPU frame ticket. Materialize the pending plan on first submission, then submit a frame. Preparation failure returns a diagnostic without publishing a frame and retains the plan for retry. Later submissions reuse the runtime, waiting only when recycling an occupied frame slot. Before hardware work begins, Compile must have succeeded with no pending construction. Attempting submission unlocks editing, including on submission failure; another submission without new edits retries the selected revision. The ticket may still have GPU work in flight; poll with IsComplete(ticket). Wait(ticket) retires the frame and publishes readbacks.",
      "details": "Record and submit one frame on the calling thread, returning its GPU frame ticket. Materialize the pending plan on first submission, then submit a frame. Preparation failure returns a diagnostic without publishing a frame and retains the plan for retry. Later submissions reuse the runtime, waiting only when recycling an occupied frame slot. Before hardware work begins, Compile must have succeeded with no pending construction. Attempting submission unlocks editing, including on submission failure; another submission without new edits retries the selected revision. The ticket may still have GPU work in flight; poll with IsComplete(ticket). Wait(ticket) retires the frame and publishes readbacks.",
      "source": "Source/ArdaInfra/ArdaDependencyGraph/Public/Graph/Node/ArdaDependencyGraph.h",
      "params": [],
      "returns": "See the declared result and status contract.",
