      "summary": "Begins a private graph edit and records operations in call order. The first authoring failure is retained; later operations do nothing and Commit returns that failure. Cancel and start a new scope to recover. Destruction cancels an uncommitted transaction, preserving the previous executable graph. Never manually end/reopen its transaction while a scope is active. Commit only queues declarations; call Graph.Compile after closing all edits before execution. Graph must outlive this scope. Distinct threads may own independent scopes concurrently; each scope itself stays in its opening thread through closure. Recording is private; only publication is serialized. A scope sees prior committed edits, never another scope's uncommitted declarations. Concurrent explicit operation-name, unversioned import or option collisions fail Commit atomically. Versioned imports share one logical identity for the same physical storage; SetResourceRevision orders their edits before compilation.",
      "details": "Begins a private graph edit and records operations in call order. The first authoring failure is retained; later operations do nothing and Commit returns that failure. Cancel and start a new scope to recover. Destruction cancels an uncommitted transaction, preserving the previous executable graph. Never manually end/reopen its transaction while a scope is active. Commit only queues declarations; call Graph.Compile after closing all edits before execution. Graph must outlive this scope. Distinct threads may own independent scopes concurrently; each scope itself stays in its opening thread through closure. Recording is private; only publication is serialized. A scope sees prior committed edits, never another scope's uncommitted declarations. Concurrent explicit operation-name, unversioned import or option collisions fail Commit atomically. Versioned imports share one logical identity for the same physical storage; SetResourceRevision orders their edits before compilation.",
      "source": "Source/ArdaInfra/ArdaDependencyGraph/Public/Graph/Node/ArdaGraphEdit.h",
      "params": [],
      "returns": "",
