      "signature": "template <class Derived, class Parameters, EArdaGraphicsStage Stage> class TArdaGraphicsStageDefinition : public TArdaExecutionNode<Derived, Parameters, EArdaDependencyNodeKind::Graphics>",
      "summary": "A shader/fixed-function operation returning a typed logical value. Describe declares this stage's shader, bindings and physical effects, without requesting a pipeline. Vertex owns the input layout; Raster owns fixed-function configuration; Pixel owns the attachments. Parameters declare their logical input with ARDA_NODE_STAGE_INPUT. Mesh accepts an empty payload when amplification is absent. Optional ConfigureGraphics fills dynamic draw inputs; the compiler issues the single assembled draw. Optional FetchBuffer(Edit, const Parameters&, const FArdaStageBufferRequest&) registers a materializer.",
