      "id": "api-arda-tardanodearray-3759d518",
      "name": "TArdaNodeArray",
      "qualifiedName": "arda::TArdaNodeArray",
      "kind": "class",
      "component": "core",
      "page": "api-reference.html",
      "signature": "template <class Value> class TArdaNodeArray final",
      "summary": "An owning array of node arguments or invocation results. Passing this wrapper at any positional parameter slot invokes one logical operation per element. All array arguments must have equal lengths; scalar arguments are copied to every lane. This is zip/broadcast semantics, not a Cartesian product. Empty arrays produce no operations. Ordinary vectors and shader parameter arrays remain single parameter values unless explicitly wrapped. Invocation freezes each parameter value before returning; nested pointees retain normal shared ownership semantics. The compiler resolves dependencies/pipelines and batches the logical lanes.",
      "details": "An owning array of node arguments or invocation results. Passing this wrapper at any positional parameter slot invokes one logical operation per element. All array arguments must have equal lengths; scalar arguments are copied to every lane. This is zip/broadcast semantics, not a Cartesian product. Empty arrays produce no operations. Ordinary vectors and shader parameter arrays remain single parameter values unless explicitly wrapped. Invocation freezes each parameter value before returning; nested pointees retain normal shared ownership semantics. The compiler resolves dependencies/pipelines and batches the logical lanes.",
      "source": "Source/ArdaInfra/ArdaDependencyGraph/Public/Graph/Node/ArdaNodeArray.h",
